- `DashboardPage.tsx` uses `useSSEWithLiveEvents` and shows `LiveActivityFeed` when live events arrive. `ActivityFeed` is kept as fallback when no live events yet.
- i18n-clean: no hardcoded Turkish or English user-facing strings added; all labels use existing i18n keys.
